      },
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}x&=\\frac{1-\\sqrt2}{1-2}\\\\x&=\\sqrt2-1\\\\x^2&=(\\sqrt2-1)^2\\\\x^2&=3-2\\sqrt2\\\\\\frac{1-x^2}{1+x^2}&=\\frac{1-(3-2\\sqrt2)}{1+(3-2\\sqrt2)}\\\\\\frac{1-x^2}{1+x^2}&=\\frac{\\sqrt2-1}{2-\\sqrt2}\\\\\\frac{1-x^2}{1+x^2}&=\\frac{(\\sqrt2-1)(2+\\sqrt2)}{(2-\\sqrt2)(2+\\sqrt2)}\\\\\\frac{1-x^2}{1+x^2}&=\\frac{\\sqrt2}{2}\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
